   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 14 00}Hey, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00} Y'know,\nI've been meaning to ask\nyou something...\n{07 06 00}Can I come see your place?\nPlease, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?!{01 00 00 05 00} I'm\nso super curious!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}Kuule, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00} Tead,\nma olen tahtnud sinult\nmidagi küsida...\n{07 06 00}Kas ma võin tulla su kodu\nvaatama? Palun, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?!{01 00 00 05 00}\nMa olen nii ülihuvitatud!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 0b 00}Y'know, I've just reached\nthe age where I'm starting\nto get interested in.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\n{07 00 00}INTERIOR DECORATING!!!{01 00 00 14 00} {07 09 00}Uh.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\nUm.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\n\n{07 14 00}Yeah, so if you don't mind,\ncan I come see your room,\n{04 1f 00}?",
   "et": "{07 0b 00}Tead, ma olen just jõudnud\nikka, kus mind hakkab\nhuvitama.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\n{07 00 00}SISEKUJUNDUS!!!{01 00 00 14 00} {07 09 00}Öö.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\nEmm.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}\n\n{07 14 00}Jah, nii et kui sa ei\npahanda, kas ma võin tulla\nsu tuba vaatama, {04 1f 00}?"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 16 00}I'm bored!{01 00 00 05 00} Talking to you is\nboring.{01 00 00 05 00} STOP BORING ME!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 00 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 0c 00}Wait,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} I know!\n{07 14 00}Lemme come visit you at\nyour place, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nThat would be fun!",
   "et": "{07 16 00}Mul on igav!{01 00 00 05 00} Sinuga on\nigav.{01 00 00 05 00} LÕPETA MU IGAVLEMINE!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 00 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 0c 00}Oota,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} Ma tean!\n{07 14 00}Las ma tulen sulle külla\nsu koju, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nSee oleks lõbus!"
